<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero-name reveal"><span>Moclif</span><span>Food</span></h1>
  <div class="hero-bottom"><p class="hero-line reveal">:)</p><a class="button reveal" href="#writing">阅读文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>
<section class="writing-section chapter" id="writing" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
  <div class="wrap section-opening"><h2 id="writing-title" class="reveal">最近写下</h2><p class="reveal">把过程留下，让想法有处可寻。</p></div>
  <div class="wrap writing-grid">
    <div class="filter-panel"><p>从一个兴趣开始</p><div class="filter-controls" role="group" aria-label="按主题筛选文章"><% ['全部','编程与建站','学习笔记','日常分享'].forEach((kind,i)=>{ %><button type="button" data-filter="<%= kind %>" aria-pressed="<%= i===0 %>"><%= kind %></button><% }); %></div><a class="text-link" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">全部文章</a></div>
    <div><div class="post-list" id="post-list"><% workbench_posts().slice(0,6).forEach(post=>{ %><%- partial('_partial/post-row',{post}) %><% }); %></div><p class="empty-state" id="filter-empty" role="status" hidden>这个主题还没有文章。先看看其他记录吧。</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="work-section chapter wrap" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="section-opening"><h2 id="work-title" class="reveal">正在搭建</h2><p class="reveal">从一个属于自己的地方开始。</p></div>
  <a class="project-entry reveal" href="<%- url_for('/projects/') %>"><h3>个人网站</h3><span>设计、构建与持续更新</span><span>2026</span></a>
  <div class="work-photos"><figure class="photo-wide reveal"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/beautiful-mechanical-keyboard.jpg') %>" width="1920" height="1440" alt="带有彩色背光和黑白键帽的机械键盘" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>从键盘开始，把想法做出来。</figcaption></figure><div class="work-aside"><p class="statement reveal">记录怎么做，<br>也记录为什么。</p><figure class="photo-small reveal"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/rs-42471-12-pcb-02.jpg') %>" width="1920" height="1285" alt="模拟电路板上的电阻、电容与可调元件" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>硬件与软件，都值得慢慢研究。</figcaption></figure></div></div>
</section>
<section class="daily-section chapter" aria-labelledby="daily-title">
  <div class="wrap daily-grid"><div><h2 id="daily-title" class="reveal">屏幕之外</h2><p class="statement reveal">也给日常<br>留一个位置。</p><p class="reveal">游戏里的片段、偶然的发现、平常的一天。日常分享会在这里慢慢积累。</p><a class="button reveal" href="<%- url_for('/daily/') %>">看看日常</a></div><figure class="photo-wave reveal"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/waves-of-luputhana-11.jpg') %>" width="1920" height="1280" alt="阳光下拍打岩岸的海浪" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Riding waves.</figcaption></figure></div>
</section>
<section class="about-section chapter wrap" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="section-opening"><h2 id="about-title" class="reveal">关于我</h2><a class="text-link reveal" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">认识 MoclifFood</a></div><div class="about-grid"><p class="statement reveal">MoclifFood 的个人工作台，放下正在学习的东西、写过的代码，还有值得分享的日常。</p><figure class="reveal"><img src="<%- url_for('/images/printed-circuit-board-9990.jpg') %>" width="1920" height="1280" alt="电路板上彩色电容和集成电路的近景" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>保持好奇，把问题一点点拆开。</figcaption></figure></div></section>
